o_SK_Fotboll\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro SK</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Europeiska_cupvinnarcupen_i_fotboll_1997/1998\" title=\"Europeiska cupvinnarcupen i fotboll 1997/1998\">Cupvinnarcupen</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intertotocupen_1997\" title=\"Intertotocupen 1997\">Intertotocupen</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Östers IF</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstads BK</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Andreas_Andersson\" title=\"Andreas Andersson\">Andreas Andersson</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">IFK Göteborg</a> (19)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a> 6–0 <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">Göteborg</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(11 augusti 1996)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborg</a> 0–6 <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">Göteborg</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(12 oktober 1996)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Målrikaste match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors_IF\" title=\"Degerfors IF\">Degerfors</a> 2–7 <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">Göteborg</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(28 april 1996)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Åskådarantal i snitt</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;04993.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>4&#160;993<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_1995\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 1995\">1995</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 1997\">1997</a> &#8594;</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"float:right;clear:right;width:374px;padding:4px;border:1px solid silver;margin:4px;background-color:white\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;border:1px solid silver;padding:0px;width:370px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fil:Map_of_Sweden_(polar_stereographic).svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Map_of_Sweden_%28polar_stereographic%29.svg/500px-Map_of_Sweden_%28polar_stereographic%29.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"370\" height=\"894\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Map_of_Sweden_%28polar_stereographic%29.svg/960px-Map_of_Sweden_%28polar_stereographic%29.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"365\" data-file-height=\"882\" /></a></span><br />\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:66.396850537311%; left:62.264999750695%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left